  "notes": "PARTIAL. The county website (guthriecounty.gov) returns a Cloudflare 'you have been blocked' 403 for HTML pages, so the 2026 General Election page and its full list of sample ballots could not be read; one Firecrawl search surfaced three official sample-ballot PDF URLs (Bayard, Guthrie Center, Stuart precincts), which downloaded directly and were parsed (9 ballot styles: Bayard, Seeley Twp, Union Twp, Guthrie Center, Jackson Twp, Valley Twp, Stuart, Beaver Twp, Diamondhead Sanitary District). Remaining precincts (e.g., Panora, Casey/Adair, Menlo, Yale/Bagley area townships) are NOT covered, so other township contests and possibly other supervisor districts/local measures may be missing. Supervisors are elected BY DISTRICT (District 1 seen on Bayard-area styles, District 4 on Guthrie Center-area styles). Township name printed as 'Seely Township' in contest titles (ballot-style header says 'Seeley Township'). Jackson Twp Trustee is printed 'Vote for no more than One' with two candidates. Diamondhead Sanitary District Trustee (vote for two) has no printed candidates. No local public measures on the three ballots read."
